*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PAY0008
*> PURPOSE : PAYROLL DEDUCTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 488
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0008.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 UNION-MEMBER       PIC X.
       88 UNION-MEMBER-2 VALUE 'Y'.
    *> GROSS PAY FOR THE PERIOD
    05 GROSS-PAY          PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> UNION DUES DEDUCTED
    05 DUES-AMT           PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-UNION-DUES
    DISPLAY "DUES-AMT=" DUES-AMT
    STOP RUN.
3000-UNION-DUES.
    IF UNION-MEMBER-2
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> HIGHER UNION DUES - LIMIT 3000 PER 1998 POLICY
            WHEN GROSS-PAY >= 2000
                MOVE 45 TO DUES-AMT
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 30 TO DUES-AMT
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO DUES-AMT
    END-IF.
